B	Does it work?	効果はある？
A	Half the time. The other half, I'm just annoyed.	半分は。あとの半分は、ただイラついてる。
B	Half is better than none.	半分でもゼロよりいいよ。
S	
A	What about a bad motto? Something you've unlearned?	逆に、捨てた座右の銘は？
