S	
A	Right, the bill's a hundred and forty-four. Four of us.	えっと、お会計は144。4人で。
B	So thirty-six each.	じゃあ1人36。
A	Plus tip. Say ten percent, that's fourteen-forty.	それにチップ。10%だとして、14.4。
B	Round it to fifteen. So one fifty-nine total.	15に切り上げて。合計159。
A	Divided by four... thirty-nine seventy-five.	4で割って… 39.75。
B	Call it forty each. Easier.	1人40にしよう。簡単だし。
A	Forty each. Does that add up?	1人40。合ってる？
B	One sixty. One pound over. The waiter can have it.	160。1ポンド多い。ウェイターにあげよう。
S	
